{"id": "msg_6d4d3312b54044a4a705239175f65c14", "role": "user", "parts": [{"type": "tool", "tool_id": "chatcmpl-tool-87fb2fbc96012fa9", "tool_name": "mcp_gateway", "tool_uri": "", "skill_uri": "", "tool_status": "completed", "tool_output": "dbx 有 18 个工具（省略 tool 参数即本清单）：\n- dbx_add_connection: Add a new database connection to DBX\n- dbx_begin_transaction: Begin a transaction on a transaction-enabled native MySQL session\n- dbx_close_session: Close a stateful query session and release its pinned backend connection\n- dbx_commit_transaction: Commit the active transaction; committed is reported only after MySQL acknowledges COMMIT\n- dbx_describe_table: Get column definitions for a table\n- dbx_duplicate_connection: Duplicate a DBX connection with its complete settings, credentials, tunnels, and sidebar group\n- dbx_execute_and_show: Execute a SQL query in DBX desktop app UI and show results there. Requires DBX to be running.\n- dbx_execute_batch: Execute a SQL script containing multiple statements in one call and return a result per statement. Statements are split with a database-dialect-aware parser,...\n- dbx_execute_query: Execute a SQL query on a database connection (default 100 rows; pass max_rows to return up to 1000 rows; larger values are clamped; MongoDB shell commands an...\n- dbx_get_routine_source: Get the full source text of a stored procedure or function\n- dbx_get_schema_context: Get compact table and column context for writing SQL\n- dbx_list_connections: List database connections configured in DBX. Returns connection IDs, names, group paths, database types, endpoints, selected databases, and saved connection ...\n- dbx_list_databases: List database names available through a DBX connection. When the connection has a database allowlist, returns only the databases allowed by DBX MCP settings;...\n- dbx_list_routines: List stored procedures and functions for a database schema\n- dbx_list_tables: List tables and views for a database connection\n- dbx_open_session: Open a stateful query session pinned to a single backend connection. Returns a session ID for dbx_execute_query: USE, SET CATALOG, session variables and temp...\n- dbx_open_table: Open a table in DBX desktop app. Requires DBX to be running.\n- dbx_rollback_transaction: Roll back the active transaction. Cleanup remains available after write-policy revocation.\n\n要调用其中某个，传 tool=<名字> 和 arguments=<参数对象>。", "tool_output_group_id": "msg_6d4d3312b54044a4a705239175f65c14", "tool_output_group_original_chars": 2150, "tool_output_group_budget_chars": 100000}], "created_at": "2026-11-26T03:15:51.809Z", "peer_id": "gitlab.zhi.com-zhi-suzhou-shiqu-suzhufang-fe-zhi2-mobile-shimin-h5-zhishu-c-unlimited"}
